{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1310205001:1":{"text":"Hello! We meet again!","source_cn":"斯瓦夫先生，又见到你啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74868EC52EF85D6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310205002:1":{"text":"Dura above, it's you! What a coincidence! I just arrived in Cedartown.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，是你们！真是巧了，我刚刚才进雪松镇，就又和你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A051A9E0776589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310205003:1":{"text":"Now where's that impressive hunter... Faramor, I believe his name was?","source_cn":"那个很厉害的白狼……法拉莫尔呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069887DF241D0681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310205004:1":{"text":"He's still got work to do, so we parted ways when we got to town.","source_cn":"他还有工作要做，刚来雪松镇就和我们分开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C847F350A7A0BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310205005:1":{"text":"I rushed here after helping that family onto a carriage. I haven't even eaten yet, but I didn't wanna miss the opening ceremony.","source_cn":"我把那一家三口送上马车就往镇子里跑，饭也顾不上吃，还好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6B889EBE117D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310205006:1":{"text":"Ah, yes! I promised to guide you around town, didn't I?","source_cn":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FE3BC1FBEE7E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1310205006":{"text":"Ah, yes! I promised to guide you around town, didn't I?","source_cn":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FE3BC1FBEE7E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310205007:1":{"text":"Yeah, your clothes are as dusty as Chippy's fur was in the Ashen Wastes. You must be exhausted!","source_cn":"对呀，你看起来风尘仆仆的，一定累坏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345031D70D27307B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310205008:1":{"text":"Grab something to eat and rest up.","source_cn":"先吃点东西好好休息一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9327E1CDDA830E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310205011:1":{"text":"Well... if you say so, I won't argue with you.","source_cn":"哎呀，这……你们这么说了，我也就不和你们争了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E4266FC3C276FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310205012:1":{"text":"But if you need anything, you can find me at the inn over there. It's called the Icy Hearth.","source_cn":"你们有需要就来找我，我就住那边的旅馆。喏，叫“雪与火”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75E773BA03E39CDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310205013:1":{"text":"Alright, see you at the festival!","source_cn":"好呀，斯瓦夫先生，咱们祭典上再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5538D6E9832607A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"You should get some rest.","source_cn":"你需要先休息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4697C10348FBCEA2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You should get some rest.","female":"You should get some rest.","variant_male_record_index":"68238","variant_female_record_index":"68239","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310205009:1":{"text":"It's been years since I've been here, but I've got a good memory!","source_cn":"哈，虽然好多年没来了，但我的记性可一向不差！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F687222E7D34130","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310205010:1":{"text":"I may not be a local, but I can show you guys around just fine.","source_cn":"就算没有你那么熟悉，可带他们在镇子里逛一逛还是没问题的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC37794DF4AFECF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Don't worry, we have a guide.","source_cn":"别担心，我们有向导","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1612C6609C417E95","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't worry, we have a guide.","female":"Don't worry, we have a guide.","variant_male_record_index":"68240","variant_female_record_index":"68241","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:商人斯瓦夫":{"text":"Trader Swafford","source":"商人斯瓦夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"Hugin","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":4}}